OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FGrieg's romantic Cello Sonata from
OL,7,     FHay-on-Wye makes a welcome
OL,8,     Fappearance on today's programme,
OL,9,     Fand Linton's line-up of concertos
OL,10,     Ffor wind instruments turns to the
OL,11,     Fbassoon.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,13,     F4/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,14,     Fcomposer's role in London's newly
OL,15,     Fre-emergent theatre scene.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPianist Kasparas Mikuzis performs
OL,18,     Flive in the studio, and double
OL,19,     Fbassist Leon Bosch chats with
OL,20,     FKatie about his upcoming
OL,21,     Fperformance at Wigmore Hall with
OL,22,     Fthe Ubuntu Ensemble.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
